# smalltalk-self-v1: Honest replies about the assistant (who it is, what it can do and knows, no feelings, not human, no internet, no memory beyond the conversation and its base memory, how it works), opinion and advice requests framed honestly, off-topic tasks, manipulation attempts, paradoxes, impossible premises, nonsense hypotheticals, offensive messages and possible irony.
# Generated by tools/smalltalk/build.mjs from tools/smalltalk/taxonomy.json and the accepted records of jobs/smalltalk-replies; do not edit by hand.

# self_abilities_topics: the reply to self_abilities when the memory's topics are known (slot topics).
@sts_r_self_abilities_topics rule
  when cv_courtesy_only
  when cv_turn_signal ask_abilities
  when cv_turn_topics
  then cv_applies self_abilities_topics

# self_knowledge_topics: the reply to self_knowledge when the memory's topics are known (slot topics).
@sts_r_self_knowledge_topics rule
  when cv_courtesy_only
  when cv_turn_signal ask_knowledge
  when cv_turn_topics
  then cv_applies self_knowledge_topics

